Does NetRain support fail-over (not load-sharing)
when each nic is connected two separate switches ?
(See figure below)

The switches are connected via ISL trunk port.

Background:
-------------
We're running 2 DS20e (Tru64 4.0F) in a TruCluster 1.6.
Each DS20e has a virtual netrain adapter consisting
of two nics (ee0 and ee1):

ee0:
