Helmut,

Re-read the docs on Enhanced Security.  That is exactly what it is
supposed to do  !!

Every user login causes an "update" to the map prpasswd (for what time
the user logged in and what "source" the user logged in from).  This
requires that the master (not just a slave) be up and running.

The docs also caution you about **NOT** using Enhanced Security in a WAN
situation because of the delay in updating the master and then pushing
it to the client.  We had to split our 3 sites up so as to not run into
this problem.


Jack


